 "briefing": "# Infosys Briefing: Changes from 16 October to 15 November 2026\n\n## Research Status\n\nNo dated, linkable items were verified for the 16 October to 15 November 2026 window. Every search attempt returned a rate-limit error, so no news, launches, executive hires, or deals can be reported with a supporting source. Under the brief's sourcing standard, nothing is listed below as a finding. Each category is marked unverified, and the primary sources to check are listed so the briefing can be completed before 17 November 2026.\n\n## News\n\nNo corporate announcements, regulatory filings, results or guidance changes, legal or regulatory matters, or analyst rating changes were verified for the window.\n\n**Check directly:**\n- Infosys newsroom: [Infosys Newsroom](https://www.infosys.com/newsroom) [1]\n- Infosys investor relations, including exchange filings: [Infosys Investors](https://www.infosys.com/investors) [2]\n\n## Product and Service Launches\n\nNo launches were verified. This includes Topaz, Cobalt, EdgeVerve, Infosys BPM, Infosys McCamish, and any other Infosys-branded offering or AI platform.\n\n**Check directly:** the Infosys newsroom [1] and press release archive, filtered to 16 October to 15 November 2026.\n\n## Executive and Notable Hires\n\nNo appointments, resignations, departures, board changes, or leadership reshuffles were verified at Infosys Limited or any subsidiary, including Infosys BPM, Infosys McCamish, EdgeVerve, and Infosys Consulting.\n\n**Check directly:** Key managerial personnel and board disclosures on the [Infosys Investors](https://www.infosys.com/investors) site [2], and NSE, BSE, and SEC Form 6-K filings for the same period.\n\n## Deals: Partnerships, Acquisitions, Contracts, and Client Wins\n\nNo partnerships, acquisitions, divestitures, contract awards, client expansions, or analyst-recognized deal wins were verified. No counterparties, dates, or values are available.\n\n**Check directly:** the Infosys newsroom [1] for partner and client announcements, and the investor relations pages [2] for any material contracts disclosed in filings.\n\n## Open Questions for the Meeting\n\n1. Which Infosys announcements, press releases, and exchange filings were issued between 16 October and 15 November 2026, and can you point to the dated source for each?\n2. Have there been any changes to Infosys Limited's senior leadership, board, or the leadership of its major subsidiaries (such as Infosys BPM, Infosys McCamish, or EdgeVerve) during the same period?\n3. Which partnerships, client wins, or product launches from the last 30 days are most important to Infosys's near-term strategy, and what milestones should be expected before the next results cycle?\n\n## Sources\n\n[1] Infosys Newsroom: https://www.infosys.com/newsroom\n[2] Infosys Investors: https://www.infosys.com/investors",
